<!--
  CONCEPT 2 (explored, not shipped): "the deck".

  Three negative frames stacked with a slight rotation, the top one caught
  mid-swipe. It tells the interaction story better than Concept 1, but the
  three overlapping bodies merge into an unreadable blob below ~24px, and the
  rotation means it never sits square in a launcher grid. Kept here as the
  record of the exploration.
-->
